# ESP32 Smart Conveyor Inspection & Automatic Reject System

An ESP32-based industrial conveyor inspection system simulated using Wokwi and PlatformIO.

## Features

- IR-based product detection
- Simulated product quality monitoring
- GOOD / DEFECTIVE classification
- Automatic servo-based rejection
- OLED real-time monitoring
- Green/Red status indication
- Buzzer alert for defective products
- Good and rejected product counters
- Start/Stop system control
- Wokwi simulation

## Hardware

- ESP32 DevKit
- IR Sensor
- HC-SR04 Ultrasonic Sensor
- Potentiometer
- SSD1306 OLED
- Servo Motor
- Green LED
- Yellow LED
- Red LED
- Buzzer
- Pushbutton
- 220Ω resistors

## Technologies

- ESP32
- Embedded C/C++
- PlatformIO
- Wokwi
- ADC
- PWM
- GPIO
- Industrial Automation

## System Flow

Product
↓
IR Detection
↓
Quality Parameter
↓
ESP32 Processing
↓
GOOD / DEFECTIVE
↓
Continue / Automatic Reject

## Simulation

This project is implemented as a Wokwi simulation prototype.
